# CLAUDE.md

## Purpose

These instructions apply to work on `{{ project_name }}`, a Reinhardt Pages
application with a native management binary and a WASM frontend.

## Project Map

- `src/bin/manage.rs` is the native management and development entry point.
- `src/lib.rs` contains shared library exports and server-only macro support.
- `src/client/` contains browser-only launcher and components.
- `src/apps/` contains application modules generated by `startapp`.
- `src/config/` contains settings, installed apps, and project route aggregation.
- `settings/` contains base and profile-specific TOML configuration.
- `Makefile.toml` contains the supported development and verification tasks.

